  "created": "2026-11-07T05:54:08.9Z",
  "description": "`Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Providers.HidApiDotNet` is a backend provider for [Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Abstractions](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Abstractions)\nthat utilizes the [HidApi.Net](https://github.com/badcel/HidApi.Net) library for hardware communication.\nIt enables applications using the `Smdn.IO.UsbHid.*` abstraction layer to operate on HID devices through the `HidApi.Net` implementation.\n\nTo use this library, the native library [HIDAPI](https://github.com/libusb/hidapi) is required. Neither this package nor [HidApi.Net](https://www.nuget.org/packages/HidApi.Net) includes `HIDAPI`.\nTherefore, please install `HIDAPI` and its dependencies on your system or place it in the output directory of the executable file.",
